{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John in Belize"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Last Year It Was Different"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Nature Around Us > Great Barrier Reef"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le09ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking To Strangers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you are travelling, you meet new people, (strangers).  You can get their attention with expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Excuse me?</span> <span class=\"italic\">Can I ask you something?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Nice to meet you.</span><br>   <br>A stranger is someone you do not know. They can be from your own country.<br>  <br>When you talk to strangers, use <span class=\"strong\">small talk</span> (<span class=\"italic\">informal chat about the weather,  the city you are in, or general details about you</span>).<br> </br> When you ask questions you can use modals for requests or Wh-/Hw- questions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Excuse me, may I ask you something?<br><span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Of course. How can I help you?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Can I ask you something else?<br><span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Sure! What is it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: When does  the next bus leave?<br><span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: There's a schedule over there at the bus stop."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "article "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "An item"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here you can find many articles of clothing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you visit a market."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "geometric"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a design with regular shapes and lines"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like the blanket with the geometric design."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pattern"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a repeated decorative design"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are many shirts with geometric patterns in the market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to recognize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to identify, to know again"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't recognize the streets."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tourist season"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a popular time of the year for tourists "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: July is our tourist season."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "so far"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "up to now"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The market is the highlight of our trip so far."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue (5-8 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use expressions and questions to start the conversation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Reply to the stranger's questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I use expressions to talk to a stranger."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask questions and make requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice pronunciation by reading aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]